From 4730d8785ec20740daec4e0fe7c347ae1975b4ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:09:37 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: Files matched to the FX mock in every mode
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Selection: the top bar is close, the count and Select all; the actions
  (Cut, Copy, Share, Delete, More) only in the bottom bar, 80 dp, which no
  longer repeats the count
- A picker's request is its own line under the bar, worded per mode
  (Choose a file / files / a folder for X, Save to… for X)
- Footers: bold title over a hint ("1 item to move / into Download",
  "2 files chosen / Tap files to add them"), icon on the main button
  (paste, check, download), filled file-name box
- Sort sheet: one row per sort with its direction, check on the one in use,
  tap it again to reverse
- Folders open as tiles by default; compact tabs with a hairline; storage
  providers on a neutral tile in Places

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
